<title>USA: Most US stock index futures down, S&amp;Ps briefly up.</title>
<headline>Most US stock index futures down, S&amp;Ps briefly up.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 23 - Most U.S. stock index futures remained lower. June S&amp;Ps briefly popped higher in line with the T-bond futures market. June T-bonds trimmed losses after five-yr note auction results. Traders said sale was decent. June S&amp;Ps bounced through 782.50 earlier in the afternoon. Trade is choppy.</p>
